# 🎨 Virtual Paint using OpenCV

A real-time **Computer Vision** application built using **Python** and **OpenCV** that enables users to draw in the air using a blue-colored object. The application detects the object through a webcam, tracks its movement, and converts the motion into virtual drawing on the screen.

This project demonstrates the fundamentals of image processing, object tracking, contour detection, and real-time video analysis using OpenCV.

---

# ✨ Features

* 📹 Real-time webcam access
* 🎯 Blue object detection using HSV color space
* 🖼️ Binary mask generation
* 📦 Contour detection
* 📍 Bounding box and center point tracking
* 🧹 Noise reduction using Morphological Operations
* ✍️ Real-time virtual painting
* 🗑️ Clear canvas functionality
* ⚡ Smooth real-time performance

---

# 📚 Project Workflow

```text
Webcam
   │
   ▼
Capture Video Frame
   │
   ▼
Convert BGR → HSV
   │
   ▼
Generate Color Mask
   │
   ▼
Morphological Operations
(Erosion + Dilation)
   │
   ▼
Contour Detection
   │
   ▼
Center Point Tracking
   │
   ▼
Store Coordinates
   │
   ▼
Connect Consecutive Points
   │
   ▼
Virtual Drawing
```

