# 🚀 Installation

Clone the repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/Thilakpriyan/VirtualPaint-OpenCV-project.git
```

Move into the project directory

```bash
cd VirtualPaint-OpenCV-project
```

Create a virtual environment

```bash
python -m venv venv
```

Activate the environment

### Windows

```bash
venv\Scripts\activate
```

Install dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Run the application

```bash
python main.py
```

